# Agent coordination

When another agent may edit the same checkout paths on this host, use `./bin/agent-coord` (or `agent-coord` on PATH) claim / negotiate / release. Skip when you are alone on those paths — judgment over ritual. See `AGENTS.md` §7 and `~/Development/agent-coord`.
